From the I2P batch (2026-10-22), read from RNS **1.5.6**, the oracle venv's installed
package (`Interfaces/I2PInterface.py`, SHA-256
47bc0fe460e60ca0e9660816441323bcb507e681bc7946866c192b38bd74fb25). The file and
